# {{ .Name }}

A Civitai App (static, no-build).

## What this is

A sandboxed static web app served in an iframe by the Civitai host. The only
mandatory file is `block.manifest.json`. There is no build step — the platform
serves these files as-is.

## Develop

Open `index.html` in a browser, or serve the directory:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8080   # then open http://localhost:8080
```

Edit `app.js` / `style.css` / `index.html`. Talk to the host via
`window.postMessage` (see the App SDK docs for the message protocol and scopes).

## Validate

```bash
civitai app validate
```

## Submit

```bash
civitai login        # once, to store your API token
civitai app submit
```

`submit` packages this directory (excluding `.git`, `node_modules`, `dist`) and
submits it for moderator review.
